00:33:43.620 --> 00:33:45.040
Megan, where's their waters?
梅根，他们的水呢？

809
00:33:45.300 --> 00:33:45.680
Megan?
梅根？

810
00:33:46.120 --> 00:33:49.240
I mean, those are kind of salty.
