但最初拍“邓迪奖”的那家并不靠近我们的片场。

827
00:34:24.960 --> 00:34:26.320
Then I asked Greg.
然后我问了格雷格。

828
00:34:27.240 --> 00:34:31.160
He said he couldn't remember, but he knows it was an empty black Angus.
他说他不记得了，但他知道那是一家倒闭的Black Angus餐厅。

829
00:34:34.660 --> 00:34:35.780
So, I don't know.
所以，我也不知道。

830
00:34:36.040 --> 00:34:37.880
So, I actually asked Tim this as well.
所以我其实也问了蒂姆。

831
00:34:37.980 --> 00:34:40.300
I said, Tim, can you tell me a little bit about where you filmed?
我说，蒂姆，你能跟我说说你们是在哪儿拍的吗？

832
00:34:40.400 --> 00:34:43.360
Because we're trying to figure out if it was where we filmed the Dundee's.
因为我们想弄清楚那是不是我们拍“邓迪奖”的地方。

833
00:34:43.360 --> 00:34:45.520
And he said, well, I can tell you this.
他说，嗯，我可以告诉你这个。

834
00:34:45.680 --> 00:34:53.900
It was like this really gross out-of-business restaurant in a kind of sketchy area.
那是一家特别恶心、已经倒闭的餐厅，位于一个有点乱的区域。

835
00:34:54.080 --> 00:34:55.820
So, maybe it was the same.
所以，也许是同一家。

836
00:34:55.900 --> 00:34:56.060
I know.
我知道。

837
00:34:56.180 --> 00:34:57.640
That makes me think it was the same.
这让我觉得那就是同一家。

838
00:34:57.740 --> 00:34:59.420
And he said, it was gross.
他说，那地方很恶心。

839
00:35:01.000 --> 00:35:03.380
Because no one had been in that building in so long.
因为那栋楼已经很久没人进去了。

840
00:35:03.480 --> 00:35:06.900
There were like little nooks and crannies of it that were kind of dusty and corrody.
里面有些角落和缝隙，又脏又腐烂。

841
00:35:06.900 --> 00:35:08.920
As I was watching it, I couldn't tell.
我看的时候，也分辨不出来。

842
00:35:09.340 --> 00:35:14.160
If it was different, they did an excellent job of making it look like it was the same place.
如果不是同一家，那他们把场景布置得跟原先一模一样，做得太棒了。

843
00:35:14.420 --> 00:35:14.620
Yeah.
是啊。

844
00:35:14.740 --> 00:35:15.580
I couldn't tell either.
我也看不出来。

845
00:35:15.800 --> 00:35:18.060
But Tim's description of it kind of brought me back.
但蒂姆对那里的描述让我回想起了当时的情景。

846
00:35:18.660 --> 00:35:20.620
Eight minutes, 34 seconds.
八分三十四秒。

