859
00:35:49.200 --> 00:35:51.380
Well, I had to make ties with mouths on them.
嗯，我得制作带有嘴巴图案的领带。

860
00:35:51.560 --> 00:35:51.740
Yeah.
是啊。

861
00:35:51.740 --> 00:35:52.640
Like a bunch of different mouths.
就像一堆不同的嘴巴。

862
00:35:52.880 --> 00:35:55.300
I made seven different mouths.
我做了七种不同的嘴巴。

863
00:35:55.520 --> 00:35:57.020
And then my boss picked one.
然后我老板选了一个。

864
00:35:57.940 --> 00:35:58.380
Okay.
好吧。

