00:36:54.180 --> 00:36:55.820
It's a great little moment in the bloopers.
那是花絮里一个很棒的小片段。

896
00:36:55.820 --> 00:36:57.660
I watched those deleted scenes as well.
我也看了那些删减片段。

897
00:36:58.080 --> 00:36:58.920
So good.
太棒了。

898
00:36:59.100 --> 00:36:59.680
So good.
太棒了。

