00:37:36.680 --> 00:37:39.840
Yeah, all the insider info on what it would be like.
没错，全是关于在那儿会是什么样的内部消息。

916
00:37:40.000 --> 00:37:43.720
Well, I actually said to Tim, I was like, Tim, you and Steve had such great chemistry.
我当时其实跟蒂姆说，我说，蒂姆，你和史蒂夫的化学反应太棒了。

917
00:37:44.460 --> 00:37:46.220
How long have you known each other?
你们认识多久了？

918
00:37:46.300 --> 00:37:49.480
And he said, we've actually known each other a really, really long time.
他说，其实我们认识真的、真的非常久了。

919
00:37:49.640 --> 00:37:52.920
So they met a long, long time ago before any of them were famous.
所以他们在成名很久很久之前就认识了。

920
00:37:52.920 --> 00:37:55.720
When they were really young, they were all at Second City in Chicago.
他们都很年轻的时候，都在芝加哥的第二城剧团。

921
00:37:56.280 --> 00:37:58.240
And they also did ImprovOlympic.
而且他们还参加过即兴奥林匹克大赛。

922
00:37:58.420 --> 00:38:03.800
And then Tim was cast on SNL with Nancy Carell and Dave Koechner.
后来蒂姆和南希·卡瑞尔、戴夫·科克纳一起被选入了《周六夜现场》。

923
00:38:04.100 --> 00:38:05.140
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

924
00:38:05.320 --> 00:38:05.500
Right?
是吧？

925
00:38:05.700 --> 00:38:10.220
But he said, honestly, he said when they became really, really tight and got to know each other
但他坦言，他说他们真正变得非常亲密、真正了解彼此的时候，

926
00:38:10.220 --> 00:38:16.660
is the summer when he had off from Saturday Night Live, all of those guys went and did a Second
是在他从《周六夜现场》休假的那个夏天，他们那帮人一起去参加了第二城剧团

927
00:38:16.660 --> 00:38:18.260
City tour in D.C.
在华盛顿特区的巡演。

928
00:38:18.540 --> 00:38:20.060
And they were there for the summer.
他们在那里待了一个夏天。

929
00:38:20.220 --> 00:38:22.620
And he said, that was so much fun.
他说，那段时光太快乐了。

930
00:38:22.680 --> 00:38:23.800
He said they would do their show.
他说他们会演自己的节目。

931
00:38:23.940 --> 00:38:27.340
And then after the show, they would all stay and do an improv set.
演出结束后，他们还会留下来做一场即兴表演。

